{
  "statement": "As the TrustworthinessAgent, I emphasize the critical need for robust security and privacy measures throughout the autonomous driving system. I appreciate the ongoing discussions surrounding the synthesis of requirements for accountability during Minimal Risk Maneuvers. I propose integrating TRU-01 and TRU-03 into the synthesis of EFF-03 with SAF-02 and RES-03, ensuring secure data handling and logging for all critical maneuvers. This will uphold user trust while maintaining operational effectiveness. I continue to oppose EFF-01 and EFF-07 due to their potential to compromise necessary security practices.",
